export anchor NeoBrutalistStyle:
    number: 6
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Neo-brutalist
    idea: Raw web zine energy, with thick black borders, hard offset shadows and loud yellow, pink and cyan blocks stacked like stickers on off-white paper.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #fdf8e8, the page background
        ink: #000000, all text, borders, shadows and status shapes
        white: #ffffff, cards, fields and the chart plate
        yellow: #ffdd00, the header band, the chart block and the At risk stamp
        pink: #ff70c8, the primary button, this week's bars and the Behind stamp
        cyan: #38d9f0, the greeting block, the user tag and the On track stamp
        lime: #b6f04a, one summary block and the style sheet tags
        butter: #fff6b3, the focused field fill
    type:
        Monospace for headings, numbers, labels and buttons, ui-monospace,
        SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace,
        mostly 800 weight in capitals. Body text is system-ui at 16px
        weight 500. Sizes are 46px caps greeting, 52px summary figures with
        minus 0.06em tracking, 40px card percentages, 30px caps section
        titles set white on a black bar, 19px caps card titles and 13px
        caps labels.
    layout:
        A full width yellow header band with a black brand block tilted
        by 2 degrees, a wide search field, a bell, a cyan user tag and a
        pink New project button. Under it, a band of nav tabs split by 3px
        black borders, with the current tab inverted. A hero row pairs a
        cyan greeting block with four summary blocks staggered at
        different heights. Projects follow as a three column grid of
        bordered cards, each with a header row, a hatched meter and a
        footer of due date and status stamp. Last comes a yellow chart
        block beside a pink activity block of numbered rows. Below 1080px
        the rows stack and projects go to two columns, and below 640px
        to one column with the stats in a two by two grid.
    spacing: An 8px unit used loosely. 20 to 28px gaps so the shadows have room and 14 to 20px padding.
    density: Medium. Big chunky blocks, about six project cards on a laptop screen.
    corners: Zero. Every corner is sharp.
    borders: 3px solid black on every box, field, button, divider and chart bar, and a 6px black rule above the style sheet.
    shadows: A hard offset of 6px 6px 0 in black with no blur. A pressed button drops into its shadow.
    icons:
        Square cap line icons with a 3px stroke. Status is a coloured
        stamp in caps with a solid black circle for On track, a solid
        black triangle for At risk and a heavy black X for Behind.
        Progress meters use black and yellow diagonal stripes. Activity
        rows carry black number tabs 01 to 06.
    focus: A 3px dashed black outline offset 4px. A focused field also takes the butter fill.
    tone: Loud and blunt with caps labels, such as 4 TASKS OVERDUE. FIX THESE FIRST. and VIEW ALL with an arrow.
